WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
Yes. I mean, most people 
don't stay in one home forever.

2
00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.400
They move when their 
needs or wants change.

3
00:00:05.480 --> 00:00:08.480
But if you love your home
 and want to stay, you can.

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.360
There's no maximum tenure.

5
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:13.600
The whole idea is to create stability
and give people the confidence

6
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.880
to put roots down if they want to.